      "text": "The factor is built from the value-weighted monthly block of `6_Portfolios_2x3.csv`, using the standard Fama-French 2x3 definition: HML = \u00bd(Small HiBM + Big HiBM) \u2212 \u00bd(Small LoBM + Big LoBM). The script reads the first contiguous block of YYYYMM rows, which is the value-weighted monthly section, and skips the equal-weighted and annual sections that follow. Months with missing sentinel values (-99.99 or -999) are dropped, since the factor cannot be computed for them.\n\n```python\nimport re\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\n\n\ndef main():\n    with open(\"6_Portfolios_2x3.csv\", encoding=\"latin-1\") as f:\n        lines = f.read().splitlines()\n\n    # Collect the first contiguous block of monthly rows (YYYYMM dates).\n    # In this file that block is \"Average Value Weighted Returns -- Monthly\".\n    rows = []\n    started = False\n    for line in lines:\n        parts = [p.strip() for p in line.split(\",\")]\n        if parts and re.fullmatch(r\"\\d{6}\", parts[0]) and len(parts) >= 7:\n            rows.append(parts)\n            started = True\n        elif started:\n            break\n\n    records = []\n    for parts in rows:\n        date = int(parts[0])\n        vals = []\n        for x in parts[1:7]:\n            try:\n                v = float(x)\n            except ValueError:\n                v = np.nan\n            if v in (-99.99, -999.0):\n                v = np.nan\n            vals.append(v)\n        # Column order in 6_Portfolios_2x3:\n        # 0 SMALL LoBM, 1 ME1 BM2, 2 SMALL HiBM, 3 BIG LoBM, 4 ME2 BM2, 5 BIG HiBM\n        small_lo, _, small_hi, big_lo, _, big_hi = vals\n        hml = 0.5 * (small_hi + big_hi) - 0.5 * (small_lo + big_lo)\n        records.append((date, hml))\n\n    df = pd.DataFrame(records, columns=[\"date\", \"value\"])\n    df = df.dropna(subset=[\"value\"])\n    df = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"date\"]).sort_values(\"date\").reset_index(drop=True)\n    df[\"date\"] = df[\"date\"].astype(int)\n    df.to_csv(\"output.csv\", index=False)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
      "type": "text"
    }
